; Limit 01: no way to read or write a word of memory at an address.
; Blocks job 1 (l0_cons, l0_data_new/set/tag/get, and the load in l0_head and
; l0_tail), and the buffer handling in jobs 4, 5 and 6.
;
; l0_data_tag is `return ((l0_val *)block)[0];` in C.

(def l0_data_tag ((block int)) int
  (load_word block))
